<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuela is moving toward a massive public debt restructuring after reporting $237.5 billion in debt, while the United States signed a military cooperation agreement with its interim government and a U.S. marine died falling overboard during a Caribbean operation linked to the renewed ties. JD Vance is under Senate investigation for allegedly steering a prized Venezuelan oil license to Vitol, and a U.S. senator also probed whether he directed the license to the trader. Illegal gold mining continues and U.S. senators are examining Vance's role in the oil deal, while UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOakxRRS1xODNKVEMzdlowcjUzd2g4amNoV0JSSzdQc0JEUXg1WWxSbGxOaGhYWDZWSlQzeldBelpvUnpXb3g3bHdMUWd4NWhiZFJRZnEtSWU4TDBXS0Q1Q21CWE9QUkxkT2YxYVI5MzlJNkVJS3FRZ3NuMG90Y0JBMFNKRGEtOEhlOUktTVJwU2hoSHVVVW56NXI0ZlZIOHo3TGt0UTc3VnA4VlV5MGZoTmlfS05qQlpQcWpiUWNtSjI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE51blBSY0VsOHlZOWlienNBYUpCRzNPMU9SaGxpZzlqX0ozT0pWSnNmeTY5RW95RDlrY3NZOFFtS05iN21QN2FPbzlNaE5YWmlLdnBzN2ZVckFzaEJpNWFmUEdLcG1oR2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBkZ0diMS03M0p4bXVmSE9WVTRKRmtIUmxjS3hKandnMnEyWkd2MTdxbDRFbXZlT0Z1NW5OWm5ueHlCM0ZGdHh2cDM2c1JVNmozaE1aUWNNMGpOZk1z?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE1CNGFESWlsQ3lnMGZfdVlNSXRfT1ByS1FzYUo0ZXpZT09hMDJMSGVVbXF3VGZlOFlTVDFBa1ZLaU1KUW1wbUFPQ3loUVpfQ2xhRmY0M3ZtZkhHX3hnVXNHTWx5M3VvZWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE93QlBzMm9LcGI3UWFHOEhfaW5MYlRtazNmODJZWl9mN3lBS3NDb1NUWTNPLTFodXBLM2lMWlZHYW9KQ3gxelBJTzdqdTR6emtuZ0g4